	(property "Description" "Specifications  💎【Mini L298N 2 Channel H Bridge DC Motor Driver Board】: Can drive two DC motors or a 4-wire 2-phase stepper motors ,can achieve forward rotation or reverse rotation, it is possible to adjust the rotation speed.for Electric Projects, Smart Car Robot.  💎【Dual H-bridge motor driver】：It can drive two DC motors or a 4-wire two-phase stepper motor.  💎【Can be rotated forward or backward】：Supply voltage 2V -- 10V, can drive two DC motors or a 4-wire 2-phase stepper motors ,can achieve forward rotation or reverse rotation, it is possible to adjust the rotation speed.  ---Product parameters---  ⚡【Supply voltage】: 2~10V.  ⚡【Input Voltage】: 1.8~7V  ⚡【Output Current】: Single Operating current 1.5A, peak current up to 2.5A, low standby current (less than 10uA).  ⚡【Built-in common conduction circuit】：when the input pin is left floating, the motor does not malfunction.  ⚡【Built-in thermal protection circuit】：Built-in thermal protection circuit with hysteresis effects (TSD), without worrying about motor stall.  【Product size】: 24.7 * 21 * 5mm (length, width, height), ultra-small size.The mounting hole diameter: 2 mm.  🥇Use of imported original chip, built-in low on-resistance MOS switch, minimal heat, no heat sink, small size, low power consumption, is ideal for battery powered."
		(at 0 0 0)
		(unlocked yes)
		(layer "F.Fab")
		(hide yes)
